jobs.requirements:
Recruitment requirements:
1.Can speak English, can communicate in English, read English documents, and compile English materials;
2.Have more than 5-10 years of working experience as a Quality Assurance (QA);
3.Proficiency in Micosoft office software applications (including Word, Excel, PPT, etc.);
4.Familiar with CAD software application;
5.Have ability to manage and lead teams;
6.Bachelor degree or above in construction engineering, civil engineering and other related engineering majors;
7.Have rich on-site construction experience.

Work content:
1.Coordinate the business work and information communication between this department and other departments;
2.Coordinate internal resources for various departments and third party vendors for the flawless execution of projects;
3.Keep current projects and processes on track with a clear focus on determined deliverables;
4.Support project planning: Create Project Charters, Project Plans and define roles & responsibilities of stakeholders in each project;
5.Provide hands-on project management managing project timeline and scope to ensure project deliverables stay on-time, on-target and on-budget;
6.Identify Risks, Issues, and dependencies and determine mitigation strategy;
